 tasks</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></solutionmaterial></solution></itemfeedback></item><item maxattempts="0"><itemmetadata><bbmd_asi_object_id>_238236_1</bbmd_asi_object_id><bbmd_asitype>Item</bbmd_asitype><bbmd_assessmenttype>Test</bbmd_assessmenttype><bbmd_sectiontype>Subsection</bbmd_sectiontype><bbmd_questiontype>Essay</bbmd_questiontype><bbmd_is_from_cartridge>false</bbmd_is_from_cartridge><bbmd_is_disabled>false</bbmd_is_disabled><bbmd_negative_points_ind>N</bbmd_negative_points_ind><bbmd_canvas_fullcrdt_ind>false</bbmd_canvas_fullcrdt_ind><bbmd_all_fullcredit_ind>false</bbmd_all_fullcredit_ind><bbmd_numbertype>none</bbmd_numbertype><bbmd_partialcredit/><bbmd_orientationtype>vertical</bbmd_orientationtype><bbmd_is_extracredit>false</bbmd_is_extracredit><bbmd_ai_state>No</bbmd_ai_state><qmd_absolutescore_max>1.000000000000000</qmd_absolutescore_max><qmd_weighting>0</qmd_weighting><qmd_instructornotes/></itemmetadata><presentation><flow class="Block"><flow class="QUESTION_BLOCK"><flow class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">________ are customized online presentations of highly summarized business information.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow></flow><flow class="RESPONSE_BLOCK"><response_str ident="response" rcardinality="Single" rtiming="No"><render_fib charset="us-ascii" encoding="UTF_8" rows="8" columns="127" maxchars="0" prompt="Box" fibtype="String" minnumber="0" maxnumber="0"/></response_str></flow></flow></presentation><resprocessing scoremodel="SumOfScores"><outcomes><decvar varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal" defaultval="0.0" minvalue="0.0" maxvalue="1.00"/></outcomes><respcondition title="correct"><conditionvar/><setvar variablename="SCORE" action="Set">SCORE.max</setvar><displayfeedback linkrefid="correct" feedbacktype="Response"/></respcondition><respcondition title="incorrect"><conditionvar><other/></conditionvar><setvar variablename="SCORE" action="Set">0.0</setvar><displayfeedback linkrefid="incorrect" feedbacktype="Response"/></respcondition></resprocessing><itemfeedback ident="correct" view="All"><flow_mat class="Block"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="SMART_TEXT"/></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></flow_mat></itemfeedback><itemfeedback ident="incorrect" view="All"><flow_mat class="Block"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="SMART_TEXT"/></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></flow_mat></itemfeedback><itemfeedback ident="solution" view="All"><solution view="All" feedbackstyle="Complete"><solutionmaterial><flow_mat class="Block"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">Executive dashboards</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></solutionmaterial></solution></itemfeedback></item><item maxattempts="0"><itemmetadata><bbmd_asi_object_id>_238237_1</bbmd_asi_object_id><bbmd_asitype>Item</bbmd_asitype><bbmd_assessmenttype>Test</bbmd_assessmenttype><bbmd_sectiontype>Subsection</bbmd_sectiontype><bbmd_questiontype>Essay</bbmd_questiontype><bbmd_is_from_cartridge>false</bbmd_is_from_cartridge><bbmd_is_disabled>false</bbmd_is_disabled><bbmd_negative_points_ind>N</bbmd_negative_points_ind><bbmd_canvas_fullcrdt_ind>false</bbmd_canvas_fullcrdt_ind><bbmd_all_fullcredit_ind>false</bbmd_all_fullcredit_ind><bbmd_numbertype>none</bbmd_numbertype><bbmd_partialcredit/><bbmd_orientationtype>vertical</bbmd_orientationtype><bbmd_is_extracredit>false</bbmd_is_extracredit><bbmd_ai_state>No</bbmd_ai_state><qmd_absolutescore_max>1.000000000000000</qmd_absolutescore_max><qmd_weighting>0</qmd_weighting><qmd_instructornotes/></itemmetadata><presentation><flow class="Block"><flow class="QUESTION_BLOCK"><flow class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">Describe the ways that analytical reports and proposals differ.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow></flow><flow class="RESPONSE_BLOCK"><response_str ident="response" rcardinality="Single" rtiming="No"><render_fib charset="us-ascii" encoding="UTF_8" rows="8" columns="127" maxchars="0" prompt="Box" fibtype="String" minnumber="0" maxnumber="0"/></response_str></flow></flow></presentation><resprocessing scoremodel="SumOfScores"><outcomes><decvar varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal" defaultval="0.0" minvalue="0.0" maxvalue="1.00"/></outcomes><respcondition title="correct"><conditionvar/><setvar variablename="SCORE" action="Set">SCORE.max</setvar><displayfeedback linkrefid="correct" feedbacktype="Response"/></respcondition><respcondition title="incorrect"><conditionvar><other/></conditionvar><setvar variablename="SCORE" action="Set">0.0</setvar><displayfeedback linkrefid="incorrect" feedbacktype="Response"/></respcondition></resprocessing><itemfeedback ident="correct" view="All"><flow_mat class="Block"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="SMART_TEXT"/></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></flow_mat></itemfeedback><itemfeedback ident="incorrect" view="All"><flow_mat class="Block"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="SMART_TEXT"/></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></flow_mat></itemfeedback><itemfeedback ident="solution" view="All"><solution view="All" feedbackstyle="Complete"><solutionmaterial><flow_mat class="Block"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">These two types of reports differ in terms of content and aims. Analytical reports offer information and analysis and can also include recommendations. These include reports to monitor and control operations, implement policies and procedures, demonstrate compliance, and document progress.&lt;br&gt;Proposals present persuasive recommendations to internal or external audiences, often involving investments or purchases. Proposals can be generated for internal needs or made to external agencies.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></solutionmaterial></solution></itemfeedback></item><item maxattempts="0"><itemmetadata><bbmd_asi_object_id>_238238_1</bbmd_asi_object_id><bbmd_asitype>Item</bbmd_asitype><bbmd_assessmenttype>Test</bbmd_assessmenttype><bbmd_sectiontype>Subsection</bbmd_sectiontype><bbmd_questiontype>Essay</bbmd_questiontype><bbmd_is_from_cartridge>false</bbmd_is_from_cartridge><bbmd_is_disabled>false</bbmd_is_disabled><bbmd_negative_points_ind>N</bbmd_negative_points_ind><bbmd_canvas_fullcrdt_ind>false</bbmd_canvas_fullcrdt_ind><bbmd_all_fullcredit_ind>false</bbmd_all_fullcredit_ind><bbmd_numbertype>none</bbmd_numbertype><bbmd_partialcredit/><bbmd_orientationtype>vertical</bbmd_orientationtype><bbmd_is_extracredit>false</bbmd_is_extracredit><bbmd_ai_state>No</bbmd_ai_state><qmd_absolutescore_max>1.000000000000000</qmd_absolutescore_max><qmd_weighting>0</qmd_weighting><qmd_instructornotes/></itemmetadata><presentation><flow class="Block"><flow class="QUESTION_BLOCK"><flow class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">Briefly explain the primary function of a statement of purpose indicating the most useful way to phrase one. You have been asked to help a company find ways to reduce the amount it spends on employee health and dental benefits. Write a purpose statement for the report that you will produce.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow></flow><flow class="RESPONSE_BLOCK"><response_str ident="response" rcardinality="Single" rtiming="No"><render_fib charset="us-ascii" encoding="UTF_8" rows="8" columns="127" maxchars="0" prompt="Box" fibtype="String" minnumber="0" maxnumber="0"/></response_str></flow></flow></presentation><resprocessing scoremodel="SumOfScores"><outcomes><decvar varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal" defaultval="0.0" minvalue="0.0" maxvalue="1.00"/></outcomes><respcondition title="correct"><conditionvar/><setvar variablename="SCORE" action="Set">SCORE.max</setvar><displayfeedback linkrefid="correct" feedbacktype="Response"/></respcondition><respcondition title="incorrect"><conditionvar><other/></conditionvar><setvar variablename="SCORE" action="Set">0.0</setvar><displayfeedback linkrefid="incorrect" feedbacktype="Response"/></respcondition></resprocessing><itemfeedback ident="correct" view="All"><flow_mat class="Block"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="SMART_TEXT"/></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></flow_mat></itemfeedback><itemfeedback ident="incorrect" view="All"><flow_mat class="Block"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="SMART_TEXT"/></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></flow_mat></itemfeedback><itemfeedback ident="solution" view="All"><solution view="All" feedbackstyle="Complete"><solutionmaterial><flow_mat class="Block"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">(Answers may vary.) A statement of purpose defines why you are preparing your report and what you plan to deliver in the report. The most useful way to phrase your purpose statement is to begin with an infinitive phrase (&lt;i&gt;to &lt;/i&gt;plus a verb), which helps pin down your general goal (to inform, to identify, to analyze, and so on).&lt;br&gt;The purpose statement to help a company find ways to reduce the amount it spends on employee health and dental benefits is &amp;quot;To identify ways to help reduce expenses on employee health and dental benefits.&amp;quot;</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></solutionmaterial></solution></itemfeedback></item><item maxattempts="0"><itemmetadata><bbmd_asi_object_id>_238239_1</bbmd_asi_object_id><bbmd_asitype>Item</bbmd_asitype><bbmd_assessmenttype>Test</bbmd_assessmenttype><bbmd_sectiontype>Subsection</bbmd_sectiontype><bbmd_questiontype>Essay</bbmd_questiontype><bbmd_is_from_cartridge>false</bbmd_is_from_cartridge><bbmd_is_disabled>false</bbmd_is_disabled><bbmd_negative_points_ind>N</bbmd_negative_points_ind><bbmd_canvas_fullcrdt_ind>false</bbmd_canvas_fullcrdt_ind><bbmd_all_fullcredit_ind>false</bbmd_all_fullcredit_ind><bbmd_numbertype>none</bbmd_numbertype><bbmd_partialcredit/><bbmd_orientationtype>vertical</bbmd_orientationtype><bbmd_is_extracredit>false</bbmd_is_extracredit><bbmd_ai_state>No</bbmd_ai_state><qmd_absolutescore_max>1.000000000000000</qmd_absolutescore_max><qmd_weighting>0</qmd_weighting><qmd_instructornotes/></itemmetadata><presentation><flow class="Block"><flow class="QUESTION_BLOCK"><flow class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">Describe a work plan and list the elements a detailed work plan often contains.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow></flow><flow class="RESPONSE_BLOCK"><response_str ident="response" rcardinality="Single" rtiming="No"><render_fib charset="us-ascii" encoding="UTF_8" rows="8" columns="127" maxchars="0" prompt="Box" fibtype="String" minnumber="0" maxnumber="0"/></response_str></flow></flow></presentation><resprocessing scoremodel="SumOfScores"><outcomes><decvar varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal" defaultval="0.0" minvalue="0.0" maxvalue="1.00"/></outcomes><respcondition title="correct"><conditionvar/><setvar variablename="SCORE" action="Set">SCORE.max</setvar><displayfeedback linkrefid="correct" feedbacktype="Response"/></respcondition><respcondition title="incorrect"><conditionvar><other/></conditionvar><setvar variablename="SCORE" action="Set">0.0</setvar><displayfeedback linkrefid="incorrect" feedbacktype="Response"/></respcondition></resprocessing><itemfeedback ident="correct" view="All"><flow_mat class="Block"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="SMART_TEXT"/></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></flow_mat></itemfeedback><itemfeedback ident="incorrect" view="All"><flow_mat class="Block"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="SMART_TEXT"/></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></flow_mat></itemfeedback><itemfeedback ident="solution" view="All"><solution view="All" feedbackstyle="Complete"><solutionmaterial><flow_mat class="Block"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">For simpler reports, the work plan can be an informal list of tasks and a simple schedule. However, if you&amp;#x27;re preparing a lengthy report, particularly when you&amp;#x27;re collaborating with others, you will want to develop a more detailed work plan.&lt;br&gt;The elements in a detailed work-plan include:&lt;br&gt;- Statement of the problem&lt;br&gt;- Purpose and scope of work&lt;br&gt;- Sources and methods of data collection&lt;br&gt;- Preliminary Outline&lt;br&gt;- Task assignments and schedule</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></solutionmaterial></solution></itemfeedback></item><item maxattempts="0"><itemmetadata><bbmd_asi_object_id>_238240_1</bbmd_asi_object_id><bbmd_asitype>Item</bbmd_asitype><bbmd_assessmenttype>Test</bbmd_assessmenttype><bbmd_sectiontype>Subsection</bbmd_sectiontype><bbmd_questiontype>Essay</bbmd_questiontype><bbmd_is_from_cartridge>false</bbmd_is_from_cartridge><bbmd_is_disabled>false</bbmd_is_disabled><bbmd_negative_points_ind>N</bbmd_negative_points_ind><bbmd_canvas_fullcrdt_ind>false</bbmd_canvas_fullcrdt_ind><bbmd_all_fullcredit_ind>false</bbmd_all_fullcredit_ind><bbmd_numbertype>none</bbmd_numbertype><bbmd_partialcredit/><bbmd_orientationtype>vertical</bbmd_orientationtype><bbmd_is_extracredit>false</bbmd_is_extracredit><bbmd_ai_state>No</bbmd_ai_state><qmd_absolutescore_max>1.000000000000000</qmd_absolutescore_max><qmd_weighting>0</qmd_weighting><qmd_instructornotes/></itemmetadata><presentation><flow class="Block"><flow class="QUESTION_BLOCK"><flow class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">List and describe the five elements that usually are part of a formal work plan.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow></flow><flow class="RESPONSE_BLOCK"><response_str ident="response" rcardinality="Single" rtiming="No"><render_fib charset="us-ascii" encoding="UTF_8" rows="8" columns="127" maxchars="0" prompt="Box" fibtype="String" minnumber="0" maxnumber="0"/></response_str></flow></flow></presentation><resprocessing scoremodel="SumOfScores"><outcomes><decvar varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal" defaultval="0.0" minvalue="0.0" maxvalue="1.00"/></outcomes><respcondition title="correct"><conditionvar/><setvar variablename="SCORE" action="Set">SCORE.max</setvar><displayfeedback linkrefid="correct" feedbacktype="Response"/></respcondition><respcondition title="incorrect"><conditionvar><other/></conditionvar><setvar variablename="SCORE" action="Set">0.0</setvar><displayfeedback linkrefid="incorrect" feedbacktype="Response"/></respcondition></resprocessing><itemfeedback ident="correct" view="All"><flow_mat class="Block"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="SMART_TEXT"/></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></flow_mat></itemfeedback><itemfeedback ident="incorrect" view="All"><flow_mat class="Block"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="SMART_TEXT"/></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></flow_mat></itemfeedback><itemfeedback ident="solution" view="All"><solution view="All" feedbackstyle="Complete"><solutionmaterial><flow_mat class="Block"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">(Answers may vary.) 1. Statement of the problem: This clarifies the problem you are addressing and helps you stay focused on the goal. 2. Purpose and scope of your investigation: This describes what you plan to accomplish and the boundaries of your work. It states what you will and will not cover. 3. Sources and methods of data collection. 4. Preliminary outline. 5. List of tasks to be accomplished: List the things to do, the amount of time needed for each task, the research necessary, and any constraints.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></solutionmaterial></solution></itemfeedback></item><item maxattempts="0"><itemmetadata><bbmd_asi_object_id>_238241_1</bbmd_asi_object_id><bbmd_asitype>Item</bbmd_asitype><bbmd_assessmenttype>Test</bbmd_assessmenttype><bbmd_sectiontype>Subsection</bbmd_sectiontype><bbmd_questiontype>Multiple Choice</bbmd_questiontype><bbmd_is_from_cartridge>false</bbmd_is_from_cartridge><bbmd_is_disabled>false</bbmd_is_disabled><bbmd_negative_points_ind>N</bbmd_negative_points_ind><bbmd_canvas_fullcrdt_ind>false</bbmd_canvas_fullcrdt_ind><bbmd_all_fullcredit_ind>false</bbmd_all_fullcredit_ind><bbmd_numbertype>none</bbmd_numbertype><bbmd_partialcredit/><bbmd_orientationtype>vertical</bbmd_orientationtype><bbmd_is_extracredit>false</bbmd_is_extracredit><bbmd_ai_state>No</bbmd_ai_state><qmd_absolutescore_max>1.000000000000000</qmd_absolutescore_max><qmd_weighting>0</qmd_weighting><qmd_instructornotes/></itemmetadata><presentation><flow class="Block"><flow class="QUESTION_BLOCK"><flow class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">Zahra has to conduct market research on the viability of her company&amp;#x27;s new product. While planning her research, she needs to define its purpose (the conclusion he needs to reach at the end of the process). She should therefore develop a(n) …</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow></flow><flow class="RESPONSE_BLOCK"><response_lid ident="response" rcardinality="Single" rtiming="No"><render_choice shuffle="No" minnumber="0" maxnumber="0"><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="20EA2104A0F347B78AF07BAA3831659D" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">problem statement</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="6E53B9C9C7534